{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"screen\": \"昂扬退潮后，耳边絮语彼此缠绕，调性像流沙抓不住重心\",\n      \"source\": \"像多个人在耳边低声絮语，彼此缠绕，找不到出口；调性又像流沙，抓不住重心，四处漂移。这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿将絮语与昂扬退潮分别作为可选的听觉联想，屏幕稿用“后”把它们改成了先退潮、再出现絮语的先后过程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"screen\": \"祈求却没有回应\",\n      \"source\": \"愿望真切，音乐却没有许诺回应。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿只是没有许诺会得到回应，屏幕稿却确定地说祈求没有得到回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"熟悉歌唱与舞曲只剩轻弱碎片，摇篮曲也在F小调破碎重现\",\n      \"source\": \"它们既像先前如歌旋律的碎片，也像那些舞曲主题的残片；另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿把摇篮曲破碎重现明确作为另一种听法，屏幕稿用“也”将这个备选解释写成了与歌唱、舞曲碎片同时出现的确定内容。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "11e0c40d-aac1-4ddd-9ff3-60ce761f625b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T032702675630Z", "elapsed_seconds": 167.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T03:29:50.070598+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5bdf283d1e3408e65c74d4960e5a2f8efce165615f3ffedac65342a74aafa502", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "